---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Documentation — LaunchKit" description="Getting started documentation for the public-site starter.">
  <article class="content prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Documentation</p>
    <h1>Start with content, not infrastructure.</h1>
    <h2>Install</h2>
    <p>Run <code>pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</code>, copy <code>.env.example</code>, then run <code>pnpm dev</code>.</p>
    <h2>Make it yours</h2>
    <p>Replace the sample copy and pages first. Add a CMS or markdown content collection when content authors need an editing workflow.</p>
    <h2>Connect forms later</h2>
    <p>The contact form is client-side validation only. Point it at an API endpoint or form provider when you are ready to collect leads.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
